1
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,990
Bu! Siang tadi di atap,

2
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:16,883
langitnya biru banget!

3
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:20,323
Tapi sore naik lagi,

4
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:23,737
mataharinya jadi bola merah!

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,000
Matahari sama, sinarnya juga sama.

6
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:31,920
Kamu lihat tiap hari.
Siapa yang ganti warnanya?

7
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,280
Pasti ada yang ganti!

8
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:40,667
Memang ada yang usil. Selalu
dekatmu, tapi tak terlihat.

9
00:00:42,367 --> 00:00:44,227
Jadi biru langit

10
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,670
dari mana asalnya?

11
00:00:46,967 --> 00:00:52,317
Tebak dulu: segelas air
diberi tetes susu, disenter,

12
00:00:52,767 --> 00:00:55,997
dari samping, warnanya apa?

13
00:00:56,267 --> 00:00:58,800
Air campur susu?

14
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:00,530
Putih, kan?

15
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:05,080
Lalu, kalau berdiri di Bulan siang hari,

16
00:01:05,367 --> 00:01:07,177
langitnya warna apa?

17
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:11,610
Di Bulan? Aku tak tahu.

18
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:13,830
Terus ada awan!

19
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:17,440
Langit biru, kok awan putih?

20
00:01:18,167 --> 00:01:20,067
Sinarnya,

21
00:01:20,067 --> 00:01:22,847
kok kadang biru, kadang merah?

22
00:01:23,467 --> 00:01:25,767
Langit memang biru, kan?

23
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:28,490
Kalau memang biru,

24
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:32,030
kok gelap usai matahari terbenam?

25
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:36,900
Karena... mataharinya pulang kerja?

26
00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:40,267
Ya, matahari pergi, biru ikut.

27
00:01:40,267 --> 00:01:43,227
Jadi biru dibawa sinar surya.

28
00:01:43,667 --> 00:01:46,127
Tapi sinarnya putih,

29
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,780
birunya mana?

30
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,880
Putih: campuran banyak warna.

31
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:55,070
Semua masuk ke mata,
otak melihatnya putih.

32
00:01:56,333 --> 00:02:00,733
Saat menyiram tanaman, kadang
ada pelangi di semburan air.

33
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:05,320
Warna itu ada di sinar matahari.

34
00:02:05,933 --> 00:02:09,343
Pakai kaca segitiga, namanya prisma,

35
00:02:09,867 --> 00:02:11,957
di dinding muncul deretan warna.

36
00:02:13,633 --> 00:02:18,693
Dulu, ilmuwan Inggris Newton
memecah sinar surya pakai prisma.

37
00:02:20,067 --> 00:02:26,800
Merah, jingga, kuning, hijau, biru, ungu!

38
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,867
Semua di cahaya putih?

39
00:02:28,867 --> 00:02:30,307
Ya, lengkap.

40
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,630
Sesak banget!

41
00:02:34,167 --> 00:02:35,900
Warnanya

42
00:02:35,900 --> 00:02:37,540
bedanya apa?

43
00:02:38,300 --> 00:02:40,930
Pernah main tali? Tali bergelombang.

44
00:02:42,233 --> 00:02:45,243
Cahaya juga begitu, maju bergelombang.

45
00:02:46,633 --> 00:02:49,793
Gelombang merah panjang, ombak besar;

46
00:02:50,833 --> 00:02:55,573
biru dan ungu pendek, seperti ombak kecil.

47
00:02:55,767 --> 00:03:00,067
Puncak ke puncak: panjang gelombang.

48
00:03:00,067 --> 00:03:02,877
Panjang gelombang beda, warnanya beda.

49
00:03:04,233 --> 00:03:06,403
Kuayun cepat, pendek!

50
00:03:07,033 --> 00:03:09,723
Biru itu ombak pendek?

51
00:03:10,767 --> 00:03:14,500
Ya. Ingat ini, nanti muncul lagi.

52
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,780
Jadi langit biru

53
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:19,080
karena udaranya biru?

54
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:22,570
Coba toples kosong isi udara,

55
00:03:23,933 --> 00:03:25,243
tampak biru?

56
00:03:25,933 --> 00:03:27,003
Tidak,

57
00:03:27,533 --> 00:03:28,693
bening.

58
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:31,550
Sedikit, bening.

59
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:34,780
Tapi udara di atas kepalamu tebal sekali.

60
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:43,267
Dari atas jelas: AU Amerika
memotret dari 20 km,

61
00:03:43,267 --> 00:03:46,527
tepi Bumi berupa garis biru tipis.

62
00:03:46,867 --> 00:03:49,787
Udara ini terdiri dari molekul kecil.

63
00:03:50,967 --> 00:03:53,947
Molekul? Apa itu?

64
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:57,230
Bayangkan bola-bola di udara,

65
00:03:57,333 --> 00:03:59,213
terlalu kecil untuk dilihat.

66
00:04:00,567 --> 00:04:02,987
Aku menghirup bola-bola juga?

67
00:04:03,967 --> 00:04:07,917
Ya, tiap tarikan napas, banyak sekali.

68
00:04:08,867 --> 00:04:13,837
Molekul kira-kira seribu kali
lebih kecil dari ombaknya.

69
00:04:14,633 --> 00:04:16,333
Seribu?

70
00:04:16,333 --> 00:04:19,300
Jadi cahayanya tembus saja?

71
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:20,620
Sebagian iya.

72
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:24,630
Tapi sebagian menabrak bola, terpental

73
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:27,170
ke segala arah.

74
00:04:27,833 --> 00:04:33,313
Ini hamburan: yang mental menabrak
bola lain, lalu mental lagi.

75
00:04:35,767 --> 00:04:37,117
Main gundu!

76
00:04:37,467 --> 00:04:40,707
Mirip, tapi mentalnya ke segala arah.

77
00:04:41,733 --> 00:04:43,133
Semuanya

78
00:04:43,133 --> 00:04:44,673
ikut terpental?

79
00:04:45,433 --> 00:04:48,263
Ya. Tapi ingat ombak pendek tadi?

80
00:04:49,833 --> 00:04:51,653
Mereka paling sering.

81
00:04:52,833 --> 00:04:55,863
Biru terpental berkali lipat dari merah.

82
00:04:57,333 --> 00:05:00,933
Berkali lipat? Biru sibuk!

83
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:02,920
Merahnya?

84
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:05,150
Merah jarang mental,

85
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,720
kebanyakan lurus ke depan.

86
00:05:08,867 --> 00:05:10,587
Merah fokus banget!

87
00:05:12,333 --> 00:05:16,723
Abad ke-19, ilmuwan
Inggris Rayleigh menghitung

88
00:05:17,267 --> 00:05:20,337
Maka disebut hamburan Rayleigh.

89
00:05:21,333 --> 00:05:24,567
Lucunya, dulu orang mengira,

90
00:05:24,567 --> 00:05:28,317
yang memantulkan biru
itu debu dan titik air.

91
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:32,720
Lalu ketahuan: kalau debu,

92
00:05:33,233 --> 00:05:36,700
biru berubah ikut cuaca,

93
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:38,440
nyatanya tidak.

94
00:05:39,133 --> 00:05:43,500
Lalu pada 1910, Einstein menghitung:

95
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:46,550
molekul udara saja cukup buat biru.

96
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:49,070
Einstein

97
00:05:49,133 --> 00:05:50,773
menghitung langit!

98
00:05:51,433 --> 00:05:53,233
Ke mana pun kamu lihat,

99
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:57,470
ada biru terpental masuk ke matamu.

100
00:05:58,533 --> 00:05:59,853
Udara,

101
00:06:00,033 --> 00:06:03,700
tak biru; ia mementalkan biru.

102
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:05,590
Yang diam-diam ganti

103
00:06:06,367 --> 00:06:07,967
itu udara!

104
00:06:08,333 --> 00:06:09,863
Kata orang,

105
00:06:10,267 --> 00:06:12,997
langit itu pantulan laut.

106
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:15,190
Kata orang.

107
00:06:15,333 --> 00:06:19,443
Tapi di gunung, jauh dari
laut, langit tetap biru.

108
00:06:21,233 --> 00:06:22,483
Sering terbalik: dari pantai,

109
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:28,540
laut biru sebagian karena pantul langit.

110
00:06:28,933 --> 00:06:31,853
Tunggu, ungu lebih pendek,

111
00:06:32,067 --> 00:06:34,077
kok langit tidak ungu?

112
00:06:35,033 --> 00:06:39,163
Bagus. Sinar surya memang sedikit ungunya.

113
00:06:39,567 --> 00:06:42,117
Sebagian diserap udara di atas,

114
00:06:43,367 --> 00:06:46,567
diserap itu ditelan, tak sampai.

115
00:06:47,267 --> 00:06:49,667
Udara ikut ngemil!

116
00:06:50,267 --> 00:06:53,517
Lagi pula, mata kurang peka ungu.

117
00:06:54,433 --> 00:06:57,633
Ungu ada, tapi bercampur,

118
00:06:58,033 --> 00:07:00,483
jadi tampak biru muda.

119
00:07:01,467 --> 00:07:03,000
Mataku

120
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,650
pilih warna juga?

121
00:07:04,933 --> 00:07:06,283
Ini paling seru:

122
00:07:07,367 --> 00:07:10,077
warnamu, mata ikut memilih.

123
00:07:10,667 --> 00:07:12,797
Mataku palet warna!

124
00:07:13,267 --> 00:07:15,517
Biru banyak terpental,

125
00:07:15,967 --> 00:07:19,377
lalu matahari sendiri warna apa?

126
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,570
Aku

127
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:22,700
cat kuning.

128
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:27,850
Banyak yang begitu. Tapi untuk
tahu aslinya, pergi dari Bumi.

129
00:07:28,967 --> 00:07:32,600
Di luar angkasa, putih.

130
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:35,430
Di sana sudah di luar
sebagian besar udara.

131
00:07:36,367 --> 00:07:38,367
Dari tanah kuning,

132
00:07:38,833 --> 00:07:41,683
karena sebagian biru terpental di jalan.

133
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:45,233
Biru kurang,

134
00:07:45,233 --> 00:07:47,123
kok masih terang?

135
00:07:48,033 --> 00:07:49,883
Yang hilang tak banyak.

136
00:07:51,233 --> 00:07:55,303
Saat cerah, separuh lebih
sinar lurus ke tanah.

137
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:58,333
Pantas

138
00:07:58,333 --> 00:08:00,123
siang tetap terang!

139
00:08:00,667 --> 00:08:02,767
Matahari sore merah,

140
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:06,010
karena lebih panas?

141
00:08:06,067 --> 00:08:09,937
Matahari siang dan sore sama, bukan ia.

142
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:14,180
Yang berubah jalan cahaya ke matamu.

143
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:16,870
Jalan berubah?

144
00:08:16,933 --> 00:08:18,693
Matahari tak menjauh.

145
00:08:19,700 --> 00:08:21,700
Ya, sama,

146
00:08:21,700 --> 00:08:25,690
yang berubah: udara yang
ditembus jadi jauh lebih tebal.

147
00:08:28,467 --> 00:08:30,377
Di atas kepala,

148
00:08:30,633 --> 00:08:34,313
cahaya turun lurus, udara sedikit.

149
00:08:34,567 --> 00:08:37,600
Hampir terbenam, miring,

150
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,920
menyusuri tanah.

151
00:08:40,333 --> 00:08:43,743
Di cakrawala, udara yang ditembus

152
00:08:44,667 --> 00:08:48,017
kira-kira tiga puluhan kali lipat.

153
00:08:48,533 --> 00:08:50,143
Tiga puluh?

154
00:08:50,300 --> 00:08:51,567
Tebal!

155
00:08:51,567 --> 00:08:54,017
Jalannya panjang sekali!

156
00:08:54,633 --> 00:08:58,793
Jalan sepanjang itu, biru
terpental, terpental lagi.

157
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:03,160
Sampai di mata, sisanya merah dan jingga.

158
00:09:04,833 --> 00:09:07,793
Makin rendah, biasanya makin merah.

159
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:12,160
Tapi jangan terus tatap
matahari, mata bisa rusak.

160
00:09:14,667 --> 00:09:16,387
Saat terbit,

161
00:09:16,633 --> 00:09:17,973
sama juga?

162
00:09:18,467 --> 00:09:21,887
Sama. Saat terbit, cahaya juga miring,

163
00:09:23,333 --> 00:09:24,823
hanya di sebelah timur.

164
00:09:26,333 --> 00:09:28,353
Biru yang terpental,

165
00:09:29,167 --> 00:09:30,617
pergi ke mana?

166
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:32,920
Ke langit lain.

167
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,490
Saat kamu melihat matahari merah,

168
00:09:39,700 --> 00:09:41,280
birunya terpental

169
00:09:42,033 --> 00:09:45,033
jadi langit biru di tempat jauh.

170
00:09:46,067 --> 00:09:49,077
Ahli cuaca AS, Corfidi, berkata:

171
00:09:49,833 --> 00:09:52,213
Senja merah karena siang langit biru.

172
00:09:54,233 --> 00:09:55,903
Senjaku

173
00:09:56,333 --> 00:09:58,463
langit biru orang!

174
00:09:58,867 --> 00:10:01,907
Air campur susu, ini jawabannya.

175
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:05,650
Senter dari samping, lihat samping,

176
00:10:06,833 --> 00:10:09,503
airnya agak biru muda.

177
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:14,210
Dari depan senter,

178
00:10:14,867 --> 00:10:17,867
cahaya tembusnya malah jingga kemerahan.

179
00:10:20,033 --> 00:10:21,233
Gelas

180
00:10:21,233 --> 00:10:24,267
langit, senja!

181
00:10:24,267 --> 00:10:26,233
Susunya berbuat apa?

182
00:10:26,233 --> 00:10:29,533
Butir susu memantulkan cahaya.

183
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:33,910
Makin jauh di air,
makin banyak biru lepas.

184
00:10:34,767 --> 00:10:38,907
Coba di rumah: air, tetes susu, senter.

185
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:42,290
Tak berwarna? Tambah 2 tetes.

186
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:44,320
Pinjam senter Ayah!

187
00:10:45,333 --> 00:10:47,733
Lalu, lihat awan di jendela.

188
00:10:47,733 --> 00:10:49,633
Awan pun disinari,

189
00:10:49,633 --> 00:10:53,313
kok tak biru atau merah?

190
00:10:54,267 --> 00:10:57,100
Awan itu titik air,

191
00:10:57,100 --> 00:11:01,370
satu titik air jauh
lebih besar dari molekul.

192
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:04,480
Titik besar memantulkan semua.

193
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:09,280
Semua warna terpental
bersama, bercampur jadi putih.

194
00:11:11,733 --> 00:11:13,533
Berkabut

195
00:11:13,533 --> 00:11:15,183
juga putih!

196
00:11:15,667 --> 00:11:18,357
Ya, kabut juga titik air.

197
00:11:18,767 --> 00:11:23,127
Kabut pagi disinari matahari, putih semua.

198
00:11:23,467 --> 00:11:25,800
Kalau mau hujan,

199
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:28,320
kok awan jadi abu-abu?

200
00:11:28,533 --> 00:11:31,243
Awan tebal, sinar tertahan,

201
00:11:31,733 --> 00:11:34,383
bawahnya kurang cahaya, jadi kelabu.

202
00:11:35,867 --> 00:11:38,017
Kadang langit sekitarnya terang,

203
00:11:39,767 --> 00:11:42,267
dibanding, mata lihat abu-abu.

204
00:11:43,133 --> 00:11:45,313
Mata pilih warna lagi!

205
00:11:46,267 --> 00:11:48,467
Tapi awan sore

206
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,000
jingga dan merah muda!

207
00:11:52,933 --> 00:11:55,353
Sinarnya sudah merah di jalan.

208
00:11:56,533 --> 00:12:00,333
Awan seperti layar
besar, memantulkan warna.

209
00:12:01,367 --> 00:12:04,067
Langit lagi main film!

210
00:12:04,067 --> 00:12:07,557
Titik air mengubah
warna langit, debu juga.

211
00:12:08,967 --> 00:12:10,547
Debu banyak,

212
00:12:10,767 --> 00:12:13,367
langit makin biru?

213
00:12:13,367 --> 00:12:15,197
Ingat tebakan dulu?

214
00:12:15,933 --> 00:12:19,183
Kamu sama dengan mereka,
tapi jawabnya terbalik.

215
00:12:21,100 --> 00:12:22,860
Debu asap besar,

216
00:12:23,267 --> 00:12:26,777
biru siang pudar, seperti kain kasa putih.

217
00:12:27,767 --> 00:12:30,077
Ini disebut kabut asap.

218
00:12:30,567 --> 00:12:33,257
Kalau tebal, siang pun langit putih.

219
00:12:34,867 --> 00:12:36,887
Langit paling biru,

220
00:12:37,333 --> 00:12:39,833
sering udara bersih.

221
00:12:40,133 --> 00:12:43,693
Pantas ada hari langitnya biru sekali!

222
00:12:44,633 --> 00:12:46,123
Debu banyak,

223
00:12:46,767 --> 00:12:48,727
senjanya bagaimana?

224
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:52,867
Tak tentu: kadang lebih merah,

225
00:12:52,867 --> 00:12:54,527
kadang malah kelabu.

226
00:12:56,100 --> 00:12:59,820
Naik pesawat sore berkabut:
senja di bawah pucat;

227
00:13:01,900 --> 00:13:05,190
lewat kabut asap, warna
di langit jadi cerah.

228
00:13:07,100 --> 00:13:09,200
Kabutnya menutupi warna!

229
00:13:10,367 --> 00:13:14,137
Kabut di bawah, awan tinggi paling merah:

230
00:13:14,900 --> 00:13:17,090
sinarnya tak lewat kabut.

231
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:20,530
Awan tinggi paling cantik!

232
00:13:21,167 --> 00:13:24,117
Ada senja istimewa dari gunung api.

233
00:13:25,433 --> 00:13:29,723
Pada 1991, Gunung Pinatubo
di Filipina meletus.

234
00:13:30,467 --> 00:13:33,337
Gasnya jadi tetesan
halus di langit tinggi,

235
00:13:35,133 --> 00:13:39,833
melayang di ketinggian sekitar 20–30 km.

236
00:13:39,833 --> 00:13:41,123
Tinggi?

237
00:13:41,233 --> 00:13:43,193
Terlihat dari tanah?

238
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:46,480
15 menit usai terbenam,

239
00:13:46,833 --> 00:13:52,383
tanah gelap, lapisan tinggi masih kena
matahari, jadi ungu muda dan jingga.

240
00:13:54,833 --> 00:13:57,933
Senja ini muncul sekitar 1,5 tahun.

241
00:13:58,967 --> 00:14:02,007
Sampai AS di sisi lain
Bumi pun melihatnya.

242
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:05,260
Gunung api

243
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:07,450
ubah warna!

244
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:10,350
Lihat senja aneh? Pikirkan:

245
00:14:11,433 --> 00:14:13,773
udara hari ini ada apa?

246
00:14:14,500 --> 00:14:19,033
Udara tambah, warna berubah; tanpa udara?

247
00:14:19,033 --> 00:14:24,683
Ingat soal awal? Berdiri di
Bulan, siang, lihat atas.

248
00:14:24,967 --> 00:14:26,167
Di Bulan...

249
00:14:26,167 --> 00:14:28,597
ada udara?

250
00:14:28,767 --> 00:14:32,737
Hampir tidak, cuma sedikit dan tipis.

251
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:36,067
Tanpa udara, tanpa bola

252
00:14:36,067 --> 00:14:38,177
yang memantulkan biru…

253
00:14:38,733 --> 00:14:40,743
Langitnya hitam!

254
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:45,370
Ya. Matahari terang, tapi
langit siang Bulan hitam.

255
00:14:46,800 --> 00:14:49,320
Tanah terang, langit hitam pekat.

256
00:14:51,300 --> 00:14:52,967
Oh!

257
00:14:52,967 --> 00:14:56,077
Ingat biru dan merah di atap?

258
00:14:56,567 --> 00:14:58,267
Sinarnya

259
00:14:58,267 --> 00:15:00,507
jalan pendek dan panjang!

260
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:03,590
Lihat langit, pikirkan:

261
00:15:04,100 --> 00:15:07,890
seberapa jauh cahaya ini berjalan padamu.

262
00:15:08,667 --> 00:15:10,737
Oh, begitu!

263
00:15:11,233 --> 00:15:13,293
Senja terunikmu?

264
00:15:14,133 --> 00:15:16,573
Warna apa, di mana? Komen!

265
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:21,940
Yuk cari 'kenapa' sehari-hari,
subscribe Kantor Oh Begitu.
